     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsProcessingTools/ref/MonitorCalc"], 
    ButtonBox["False",
     BaseStyle->"Link"], Cell["\<\
MonitorCalc is an option for many processing functions. When true the process \
of the calculation is shown.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"7be876f9-ff63-d143-9c17-1647508dfd21"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "44f97d32-3975-3147-b5ac-ef3e0ea5cc6d"], 
    ButtonBox["UnwrapDimension",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->
      "paclet:QMRIToolsDixonTools/ref/UnwrapDimension"], "\"\<3D\>\"", 
    Cell["\<\
UnwrapDimension is an option for Unwrap. Can be \"2D\" or \"3D\". 2D is for \
unwarpping 2D images or unwrapping 
the individual images from a 3D dataset (does not unwrap in the slice \
direction). 
3D unwraps a 3D dataset in all dimensions.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"27ca1bb3-a22d-c743-aab2-3e7e2d6dd89b"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "6b46ee48-085d-ae4a-9e2e-5ff6ca791ea9"], 
